Educational use — IIITDM Kancheepuram.

This project is developed as part of the Final Year Project at
Indian Institute of Information Technology, Design and Manufacturing (IIITDM), Kancheepuram.

Third-party IP cores used under their respective licences:
- Ethernet MAC core: LGPL (OpenCores, Mohor)
- CAN controller: LGPL (OpenCores, Mohor)
